cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite a specific handbook, please cite that book's edition rather than the repository as a whole."
title: "Handbooks: source-controlled technical handbooks with reproducible builds"
abstract: >-
  A monorepo of short technical handbooks. Each book keeps its canonical manuscript under
  version control and publishes verifiable artifacts (PDF, EPUB, HTML and single-file
  Markdown) through GitHub Releases with build provenance attestation.
type: software
